{"id":"n53919-1-7","stage":4,"title":"디디다 · 迈","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n53919-1-7-1","ko":"어쩌다 다리가 부러졌니?","zh":"你怎么会摔断腿的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어쩌다","meaning":"意外地","explanation":"어쩌다：意外地","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14591","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다리가","meaning":"腿，下肢","explanation":"다리：腿，下肢；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62840","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부러졌니?","meaning":"折，折断","explanation":"부러지다：折，折断；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"부러지다","audio":"/audio/80e45e1df2d265d68007.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26310","senseId":"1","lemma":"부러지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"意外地","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"14591","definition":"不料偶然地。","pronunciation":["어쩌다"]},{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"腿，下肢","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"62840","definition":"人或动物身体下的，做站、走、跳的动作的身体部位。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"80e45e1df2d265d6","term":"부러지다","zh":"折，折断","audio":"/audio/80e45e1df2d265d68007.mp3","entryId":"26310","definition":"坚硬的物体弯成两半，变得重叠或断开。","pronunciation":["부러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b69bd4582a835069ff84.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n53919-1-7-2","ko":"발을 잘못 디뎌서 계단에서 굴렀어.","zh":"是因为踩错了地方，从楼梯上滚下来的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"발을","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘못","meaning":"错","explanation":"잘못：错","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62478","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"디뎌서","meaning":"迈，登","explanation":"디디다：迈，登；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"디디다","audio":"/audio/fe1e77e4846e4d709d33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53919","senseId":"1","lemma":"디디다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계단에서","meaning":"阶梯，楼梯","explanation":"계단：阶梯，楼梯；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"계단","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23937","senseId":"1","lemma":"계단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"굴렀어.","meaning":"滚动，转动","explanation":"구르다：滚动，转动；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"구르다","audio":"/audio/140d9b165c63ec99bc01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34811","senseId":"1","lemma":"구르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"45a4bd47fdb2ffcd","term":"발","zh":"足，脚","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3","entryId":"67886","definition":"人或动物腿部的最末端部分。","pronunciation":["발"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62478","definition":"不正或错误地。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"fe1e77e4846e4d70","term":"디디다","zh":"迈，登","audio":"/audio/fe1e77e4846e4d709d33.mp3","entryId":"53919","definition":"提着脚站。","pronunciation":["디디다"]},{"id":"cbd5d64a59da9222","term":"계단","zh":"阶梯，楼梯","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3","entryId":"23937","definition":"为了上下走动而按顺序把小台阶倾斜连接起来的设施。","pronunciation":["계단","게단"]},{"id":"140d9b165c63ec99","term":"구르다","zh":"滚动，转动","audio":"/audio/140d9b165c63ec99bc01.mp3","entryId":"34811","definition":"在地上不停地滚来滚去转移地方。","pronunciation":["구르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/885973cdbcd48aca30f2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.042,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=53919","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":